<title>DUBAI: Dubai executes three Indians for murders.</title>
<headline>Dubai executes three Indians for murders.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dubai on Friday executed three Indians convicted of shooting to death an Indian and a Nepali man, journalists said.</p>
<p>They said the three men were shot by a firing squad for the premeditated killings in 1995.</p>
<p>Some local newspapers said the killings were the result of feuding between two rival gangs.</p>
<p>Capital punishment has been rare in United Arab Emirates member Dubai, with the execution of a man in October for raping and killing a seven-year-old girl the only other case in recent years.</p>
</text>
